# Copy to .env (gitignored) and adjust. Read by `./mvnw spring-boot:run`, `make run` and `java -jar`.
# Unquoted values only. Anything also set as a real environment variable takes precedence.
# The registry needs no credentials or addresses; the only setting is its port.

# Optional. The registry listens on 8761 by default, which is where every service looks for it
# (http://localhost:8761/eureka/), so leave it unset unless you know the clients are changed too.
#SERVER_PORT=8761
